 "description": "Who says you must choose? The all-new Aquila 42 Coupe power catamaran delivers both sport boat thrills and yacht comforts.\nStep aboard and you'll immediately appreciate how this boat refuses to compromise. Its generous beam creates remarkable space for entertaining, while the single-level layout flows intuitively from salon to cockpit. This fresh design captures all the excitement of a sport boat with double stepped hulls while delivering premium features—two private cabins with en-suite bathrooms and separate showers.\nThe innovative carbon fiber Aquila Hydro Glide® foil system that sets Aquila apart ensures your ride is smooth and efficient, whether powered by twin Mercury outboards or Volvo Penta inboards. From hidden coves to coastal towns, from afternoon cruises to weekend getaways, the 42 Coupe transforms every journey.\nEqual parts refined and ready-for-anything, this power catamaran is built for those who want it all.\nBecause out there, possibility beckons.",
